[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――完成した。うん、いい出来。\n思ったより早くできたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Done. Looks good. Finished faster than I expected."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シャル、シャリー、エスカさんとロジーさんも、\n手伝ってくれてありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lotte, Stera — and Escha, Logy — thank you all for your help."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どういたしまして！\nこちらこそ、頼ってくれてありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't mention it! If anything, thank you for asking us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "エスカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Escha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また何かあったら、気軽に声をかけてくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you ever need a hand again, just say the word."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロジー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……これ、姉さんに渡してくる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm going to go give this to her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユリエさん、きっと喜んでくれますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sure Jurie will love it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、絶対だよ！\u3000\nミルカ、行ってらっしゃい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She absolutely will! Go on, get out of here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう。行ってくる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks. I'll be back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……まったく、素直じゃないなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...She never makes things easy, does she."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカのこと。\nほんとは、寂しいはずなのにさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca. She's sad about it, even if she won't say so."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカって、ユリエさんと一緒にいるときは\nすこーしだけ柔らかい表情になるんだよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whenever she's with Jurie, her expression softens — just a little."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本人は気付いてないかもだけど！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She probably doesn't even realize it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャルロッテ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallotte"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふふ。うん、そうだね。\nわたしもそう思う",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hehe. You're right. I think so too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにきっと、\n寂しいのはミルカさんだけじゃなくて――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I'm sure Miruca isn't the only one who'll be feeling the distance..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シャリステラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shallistera"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……姉さん、ここにいたのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...There you are."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカ、どうしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca? What's up?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……これ、砥石。旅で集めた素材で調合したの。\n……姉さんの旅に役立つと思って",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...A whetstone. I made it from materials we gathered on the trip. ...I thought it might be useful for your travels."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ありがとう。\nすごく嬉しい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thank you. This really means a lot to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉さんは、よく武器の手入れをしてるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're always taking care of your weapons, so..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカの砥石なら、どんな刃もきっと長持ちするわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A whetstone made by you — I'm sure it'll keep any blade sharp for a long time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……姉さんは、きっとこの先の旅でも、\n本を書くのよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You'll keep writing books on your travels, won't you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。色んな場所に行って、色んなものを見て……\nきっと素敵な本にして、ミルカに届ける",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. I'll go to new places, see new things... and turn it all into something wonderful to bring back to you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、姉さんならできる。たくさん、たくさん、\n姉さんが望むだけ書いてほしい。だから――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know you will. Write as much as you want — as many as you like. So please..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "応援してる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm rooting for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ミルカの気持ち、ちゃんと伝わった。\nありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I hear you. Every word. Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……姉さんが無事に帰ってくるなら、それでいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Just come back safe. That's all I need."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は必ず帰る。\nミルカの砥石と一緒に、ね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I will. And your whetstone is coming with me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカ、あなたは私の誇りよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca — you are my pride and joy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉さん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Sis..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "砥石、大切に使うわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll take good care of it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この先の旅でも、きっと新しい物語を見つけてくる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll find new stories out there. I promise."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカの砥石があれば、\nどんな困難も乗り越えられる気がする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With your whetstone at my side, I feel like I can handle anything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……姉さん、無理はしないで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Just don't push yourself too hard."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、約束する",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I promise."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "異邦人の錬金術士。マリオンの仕事を手伝っている。\nアトリエを訪れたところ、ミルカに声をかけられた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A wanderer alchemist who has been helping Marion with her work. She happened to be visiting the atelier when Miruca reached out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "エスカ・メーリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Escha Malier"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "異邦人の錬金術士。通称「ロジー」。\nアトリエを訪れたところ、ミルカに声をかけられた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A wanderer alchemist, better known as Logy. He happened to be visiting the atelier when Miruca reached out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロジックス・フィクサリオ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logix Ficsario"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]